 "summary": "The Legrand hotel room controller runs one guest room's lighting, shutters, power circuits, thermostats and room services and exposes them on BACnet IP. The object map is fixed: presence and PMS flags, power and lighting circuits, DALI and BUS SCS dimmer groups, up to four BUS SCS thermostats, do-not-disturb / make-up-room and ten scenario triggers.",
